  "renderedHtml": "</div> \n    </div>\n<div id='main' class='all_colors' data-scroll-offset=\"0\">\n<div id=\"av_section_1\" class=\" only-desktop avia-section main_color avia-section-no-padding avia-no-border-styling avia-full-stretch avia-bg-style-scroll  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_submenu  avia-builder-el-first   av-minimum-height av-minimum-height-custom container_wrap fullsize\" style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; background-image: url(\nhttps://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/hoempage-image.jpg); background-attachment: scroll; background-position: center center; \" data-section-bg-repeat=\"stretch\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"height:450px\"></div></div>\n    <div id=\"av_section_mobile\" class=\" only-mobile\"  style=\"max-height:450px; max-width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/hoempage-image.jpg\"></div>\n<div class='clear'></div>\n<div id=\"home-welcome\" class=\"avia-section main_color avia-section-no-padding avia-no-border-styling avia-bg-style-scroll  avia-builder-el-20  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_hr  container_wrap fullsize\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"template-page content  av-content-full alpha units\"><div class=\"post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-22\"><div class=\"entry-content-wrapper clearfix\">\n<div class=\"flex_column av_one_full  av-animated-generic fade-in  flex_column_div first  avia-builder-el-21  el_before_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-first  \" style=\"padding:50px 80px 0px 80px ; border-radius:0px; \"><section class=\"av_textblock_section\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\"><div class=\"avia_textblock \" itemprop=\"text\"><h1 style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom:0;\">The Complete Restoration company</h1>\n    <h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">A professional and comprehensive service for the restoration of period buildings</h2>\n    <h3 class=\"margin-top:30px !important;\">The Complete Restoration Company are award winning experts in the field of building restoration and conservation. Our high quality work can be seen all over Hertfordshire and London.\r\n</h3>\n</div></section></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n        <div class=\"herald-fa-list\">\n            <article class=\"herald-fa-item \" id=\"herald-item-0\">\t    \t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"entry-header\" style=\"transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n                                                        <h2 class=\"entry-title h6\"><a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/building-restoration/\">Building Restoration</a></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We specialise in house restoration, working with our clinets to offer a bespoke service that allows the beautiy of the property to shine though.</p>\n                                                        <hr class='hrhome'>\n           <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/building-restoration/\" class=\"fa-post-bg\">Confirm</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t      \n\t\t\t\t    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"fa-post-thumbnail background-image-holder1\" href=\"\" title=\"Building Restoration\" style=\"background-image: url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/building-restoration-alt.jpg)\">\n          </a>\t\n\t\t\t  </article>\n \t      <article class=\"herald-fa-item \" id=\"herald-item-1\">\t    \t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"entry-header\" style=\"transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n                                                        <h2 class=\"entry-title h6\"><a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/internal/\">Internal</a></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For the complete restoration of your property, call us to provide details on how we can create amazing rooms for you to enjoy.</p>\n                                                        <hr class='hrhome'>\n           <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/internal/\" class=\"fa-post-bg\">Confirm</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t      \n\t\t\t\t    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"fa-post-thumbnail background-image-holder1\" href=\"\" title=\"Internal\" style=\"background-image: url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/internal-image.jpg)\">\n          </a>\t\n\t\t\t  </article>\n \t      <article class=\"herald-fa-item \" id=\"herald-item-2\">\t    \t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"entry-header\" style=\"transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n                                                        <h2 class=\"entry-title h6\"><a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/external/\">External</a></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Sympathetic and knowledgeable building facade restoration is a specialised skill encompassing several highly prized trades</p>\n                                                        <hr class='hrhome'>\n           <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/external/\" class=\"fa-post-bg\">Confirm</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t      \n\t\t\t\t    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"fa-post-thumbnail background-image-holder1\" href=\"\" title=\"External\" style=\"background-image: url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/building-restoration-page-image.jpg)\">\n          </a>\t\n\t\t\t  </article>\n \t      <article class=\"herald-fa-item \" id=\"herald-item-3\">\t    \t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"entry-header\" style=\"transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n                                                        <h2 class=\"entry-title h6\"><a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/floor-restoration/\">Floor restoration</a></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>More and more of us are preferring natural wood floors in our homes - they're easier to clean, won't stain and don't harbour dust mites. </p>\n                                                        <hr class='hrhome'>\n           <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/floor-restoration/\" class=\"fa-post-bg\">Confirm</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t      \n\t\t\t\t    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"fa-post-thumbnail background-image-holder1\" href=\"\" title=\"Floor restoration\" style=\"background-image: url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/floor-restoration3.jpg)\">\n          </a>\t\n\t\t\t  </article>\n \t        </div>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n<section class=\"row target-section\" id=\"row_columns\" ><a name=\"featured\" class=\"anchor_position\"></a>\n  <div class=\"home-intro-texto\" id=\"landlords-column\">\n    <div class=\"\" >\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n                <h3 style=\"text-transform:none !important;\">The Complete Restoration Company brings period beauty back to life, making sure each project or item fits perfectly for contemporary or traditional living and design.</h3>\n              <p>From <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/floor-restoration/\">floor restoration</a> to <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/shot-blasting/\">shot blasting</a>, we use a wide range of techniques to undertake a broad range of restoration work on all types of building restoration and architectural features.</p>\n<p>Take a look at our website and discover the type of work we undertake and some examples of work we&#8217;ve done in the past. If you&#8217;ve got a specific project that you would like advice on or help with, then please feel free to get in touch</p>\n             </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"home-contact-form\"  id=\"tenants-column\">\n<div class=\"homformdetail\"  style=\"background:#6e6e6d url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/form_bricks.svg);no-repeat;cover;\">\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n              <h2 id=\"form-title\">Get Quote today</h2>\n             <p id=\"form-subtitle\"></p>\n               <div role=\"form\" class=\"wpcf7\" id=\"wpcf7-f521-p1593-o1\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"></div>\n<form action=\"/#wpcf7-f521-p1593-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form form-contact\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" id=\"form-contact\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"521\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.1.3\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f521-p1593-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"1593\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" />\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-name\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"your-name\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Name:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-email\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"your-email\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-validates-as-email enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Email:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-tel\"><input type=\"tel\" name=\"your-tel\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-te